/*
  PDFRender - stream filters: Flate (in-house RFC1950/1951 inflate),
  LZW, PNG/TIFF predictors, ASCII85, ASCIIHex, RunLength.

  The inflate is written from the DEFLATE specification (RFC 1951) and
  verified on the host against Python's zlib as an oracle (see
  test/host).  It uses a 9-bit primary lookup table per Huffman tree
  with a canonical bit-by-bit fallback for longer codes.

